  moment "T4.M6 · The design moves (main path)"
    // the main path of the story
    design: GapResolved  // S:752 "GapResolved {resolution, rationale?, computedBy?, carriedFrom?}"
    // GapResolved -> StartPass(Convergence, scope: that Gap's construct), its ID derived from the disposal event; it re-evaluates, clears and commits if nothing blocks; a disposal pass does not re-ask  // S:729 "**every Gap disposal** (GapResolved, GapWaived or GapMooted) → StartPass(Convergence, scope: that Gap's construct)"
    design: StartPass  // S:729 "**every Gap disposal** (GapResolved, GapWaived or GapMooted) → StartPass(Convergence, scope: that Gap's construct)"
      triggered-by GapResolved  // S:729 "every Gap disposal (GapResolved, GapWaived or GapMooted)" (policy GapResolvedStartsConvergencePass)
    design: PassStarted  // S:672 "PassStarted {startPosition, CorpusVersion, RulesVersion}"
    design: RecordGateResults  // S:669 "RecordGateResults(sequence number, evaluated constructs[], findings[])"
      triggered-by PassStarted  // S:720 "Gate run: PassStarted → GateRun" (policy PassStartedRunsGates)
    design: GatesEvaluated  // S:674 "GatesEvaluated {judgements}"
    design: CompletePass  // S:723 "**Completion:** GatesEvaluated → CompletePass."
      triggered-by GatesEvaluated  // S:723 "Completion: GatesEvaluated → CompletePass" (policy GatesEvaluatedCompletesPass)
    design: PassCompleted  // S:675 "PassCompleted {ConvergenceSnapshot, verdict, actor, CorpusVersion, RulesVersion, startPosition, asOf, CauseKey}"
    design: ConstructCleared  // S:723 "records PassCompleted plus ConstructCleared for each evaluated construct with no blocking Gap"
    design: CommitConstruct  // S:724 "ConstructCleared → CommitConstruct."
      triggered-by ConstructCleared  // S:724 "ConstructCleared → CommitConstruct" (policy ConstructClearedCommits)
    design: ConstructCommitted  // S:554 "ConstructCommitted;"
    // QuestionResolved -> the closure post (always posted: a poster side effect) and the other Gaps' questions withdrawn Mooted (T5)  // S:1099 "**Closing:** QuestionResolved → a closure post with the same key rule. Closures are always posted."
    // The request Receipt ends with MarkProcessed, the unit of work's last command (effect Applied when any command ran)  // S:373 "effect Applied when any command ran in the Cycle"
    intake: MarkProcessed  // S:317 "MarkProcessed(effect?);"
    intake: ReceiptProcessed [terminal]  // S:322 "ReceiptProcessed {effect: Applied | None(reason)};"

  moment "T4.O4 · The conversation moved the design (terminal)"
    // PROVES: QuestionResolved -> GapResolved recorded for the generation (AnswerApplied, GapWaived and BoundaryChangeRatified are the other routes' flows); the closure is posted; the construct is committed; the disposal pass completed  // S:1327 "GapResolved | StartPass(Convergence, scope); the carry (a Resolved Gap of the same rule and finding identity on a lineage-root predecessor); convergence read model (computed answers listed by rule)"
    note design: "The convergence read model folds the recorded events into the baseline and the inputs of the verdict"  // S:1327 "convergence read model (computed answers listed by rule)"
